@host = http://localhost:5000
@tripId = trip-demo-001

### Service info
GET {{host}}/

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Trip live presence
GET {{host}}/api/trips/{{tripId}}/live/presence

### Broadcast trip status (SignalR)
POST {{host}}/api/trips/{{tripId}}/live/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "started",
  "message": "Trip is on the way",
  "triggeredByUserId": "user-1"
}

### Broadcast live location (SignalR server proxy)
POST {{host}}/api/trips/{{tripId}}/live/location
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-1",
  "displayName": "Lav",
  "latitude": 26.9124,
  "longitude": 75.7873,
  "speedKmh": 40,
  "heading": 180
}

### Search locations
GET {{host}}/api/locations?countryCode=IN

### Create location
POST {{host}}/api/locations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Udaipur",
  "city": "Udaipur",
  "country": "India",
  "countryCode": "IN",
  "latitude": 24.5854,
  "longitude": 73.7125,
  "type": "City",
  "state": "Rajasthan",
  "region": "Rajasthan",
  "description": "City of Lakes",
  "timezone": "Asia/Kolkata"
}
